
  <sn><md>### `rclone lsl`

The `lsl` command work same as `ls` command.The main difference between them that it include modification date and time in the output message.

```text
FILE_SIZE    MODIFICATION_DATE_AND_TIME    FILE_PATH
```

| Information       | Description                 |
| ----------------- | --------------------------- |
| File size         | Size of the file in bytes   |
| Modification time | Last modified date and time |
| File path         | Location of the file        |

</md></sn>
